          "_name": "news09",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"news09 startm5\" group=\"News\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showDate\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Time\" name=\"showTime\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Location\" name=\"showLocation\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Price\" name=\"showPrice\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#9fe870\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#edefeb\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n      <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Featured programs</b></h3>\n      <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n      </h5>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n      <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Volunteer Agriculture</b></h5>\n            <div class=\"details\">\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDate\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-calendar mobi-mbri details-icon\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">November 15, 2023<br></p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTime\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-timer mobi-mbri details-icon\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">1:00 PM - 3:00 PM<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"details\" mbr-if=\"showLocation\">\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-map-pin mobi-mbri details-icon\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">Mwanza region, Tanzania</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"details\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\">\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont details-icon mobi-mbri-cash mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">€ 1.974 (indicative) For 6 weeks</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Discover rural life and contribute to local farming communities as an agriculture volunteer. Teach smallhorders how to be more efficient growing crops or keeping livestock. Help schools by setting up an agricultural plan to gain income and provide meals to the students. Discuss the positive outcome of well kept land with small groups.</h6>\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"page2.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Volunteer Teaching</b></h5>\n            <div class=\"details\">\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDate\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-calendar mobi-mbri details-icon\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">November 25, 2023<br></p>\n              </div>\n             <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTime\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-timer mobi-mbri details-icon\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">2:00 PM - 4:00 PM<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"details\" mbr-if=\"showLocation\">\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-map-pin mobi-mbri details-icon\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">Mwanza region, Tanzania<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"details\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\">\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont details-icon mobi-mbri-cash mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">€ 1.974 (indicative), For 6 weeks<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Experience the beauty of Mwanza, Tanzania while making a positive impact teaching children. Help teachers setup a program for subjects and learn from each other’s skills. Be creative and organize small school events like games and sports. Make music, sing and dance with the young ones or have discussions with debating groups at schools.&nbsp;</h6>\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Volunteer Healthcare</b></h5>\n            <div class=\"details\">\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDate\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-calendar mobi-mbri details-icon\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">November 25, 2023<br></p>\n              </div>\n             <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTime\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-timer mobi-mbri details-icon\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">2:00 PM - 4:00 PM<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"details\" mbr-if=\"showLocation\">\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-map-pin mobi-mbri details-icon\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">Mwanza region, Tanzania<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"details\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\">\n              <div class=\"details-item\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont details-icon mobi-mbri-cash mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\">€ 1.974 (indicative), For 6 weeks</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Gain hands-on experience in healthcare while making a difference in underserved communities. Help dispensaries and learn from each other’s skills. Visit patients at home in the rural area and help them treat their wounds and injuries. Try to make adifference at one of the nearby hospitals and/or help disabled children at schools.</h6>\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uGVDAF4Ic2",
          "_anchor": "news09-8",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".img-wrapper": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "img": {
              "margin": "auto",
              "width": "200px"
            },
            ".row": {
              "align-items": "flex-start"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "background": "@cardColor",
              "padding": "1rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px)": {
                "padding": "2rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "3rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            }
          },
          "_name": "clients03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"clients3\" group=\"People\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showmainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showmainSubtitle\" checked>\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <header>Cards</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"BG\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#645600\" selected>\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n      <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n        <div class=\"mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showmainTitle || showmainSubtitle\">\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showmainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n            <b>Our Partners</b></h5>\n          <div class=\"col-12\">\n            <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showmainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Trusted and endorsed by</h6>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}} active\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/volunteer-tanzania-partners-hogeschool-amsterdam-1-400x86.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Our Clients\n            </h6>\n            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n              <b>Our partner</b>\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n              Use Mobirise website building software to create multiple sites\n              for your clients.\n            </p>\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd, -mbrBtnMove, -mbrBtnRemove\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n              <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/volunteer-tanzania-partners-supportschoolfees-1-400x54.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Our Clients\n            </h6>\n            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n              <b>Our partner</b>\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n              No special actions required, all sites you make with Mobirise are\n              mobile-friendly.\n            </p>\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd, -mbrBtnMove, -mbrBtnRemove\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n              <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/volunteer-tanzania-partners-hogeschool-amsterdam-2-400x86.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Our Clients\n            </h6>\n            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n              <b>Our partner</b>\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n              No special actions required, all sites you make with Mobirise are\n              mobile-friendly.\n            </p>\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd, -mbrBtnMove, -mbrBtnRemove\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n              <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uGVNRMDh5u",
          "_anchor": "clients03-a",
